---
import StaticPage from '../layouts/StaticPage.astro';
import { SITE_NAME } from '../consts';
---

<StaticPage
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description={`How ${SITE_NAME} collects, uses, and protects visitor information.`}
  canonicalPath="/privacy-policy/"
  updated="September 2026"
>
  <p>
    This Privacy Policy describes how {SITE_NAME} ("we", "us") handles information
    when you visit this website. We are committed to minimizing data collection
    and being transparent about what we gather.
  </p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Server logs:</strong> our hosting provider (Cloudflare) may retain standard server logs (IP address, browser type, pages visited, timestamp) for security and operational purposes. We do not directly access or control these logs.</li>
    <li><strong>No analytics:</strong> we do not currently run any analytics or tracking service on this site.</li>
    <li><strong>No newsletter:</strong> we do not currently operate a newsletter or email subscription.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we use information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To operate, secure, and serve the website.</li>
    <li>To understand aggregate traffic patterns through our hosting provider's standard logs (no personally identifying analytics).</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>
    This website does not set any cookies of its own. Our hosting provider may
    set technical cookies required to serve the site; we do not control those
    cookies. We do not use advertising or tracking cookies.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-party content</h2>
  <p>
    Article pages link to official U.S. government source websites (such as
    weather.gov, fda.gov, cpsc.gov, earth quake.usgs.gov, and nasa.gov). Those
    sites have their own privacy policies that govern how they handle your
    information.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of personal data we
    hold about you by contacting us through our <a href="/contact/">Contact</a>
    page.
  </p>

  <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
  <p>
    This site is not directed at children under 13, and we do not knowingly collect
    their personal information.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this policy from time to time. Material changes will be reflected
    by the "Last updated" date above.
  </p>
</StaticPage>
